  "definition": "Detection of Violation",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-07-03",
  "historyNote": "#8422, eff 8-23-05, EXPIRED: 8-23-13 New. #10634, eff 7-2-14; ss by #14009, eff 7-3-24",
